source: tui/src/chatwidget/tests/status_surface_previews.rs
expression: status_line_popup_snapshot(&mut chat)
---
  Configure Status Line
  Choose fields and rows. Move Start next line between fields. Alt+Enter adds a line.

  Type to search

› [x] Use theme colors     Apply colors from the active /theme
  ───────────────────────
  [x] project-name         Project name (omitted when unavailable)
  [x] git-branch           Current Git branch (omitted when unavailable)
  [x] thread-title         Current thread title, or thread identifier when unnamed
  [x] profile              Config profile selected with --profile (omitted when unset)
  [x] provider             Model provider for the active thread
  [ ] Start next line      Start the next line; move fields before or after this marker
↓
  my-project · feat/awesome-feature · thread title · profile: <name> · provider: <id>
  space toggle · ←/→ reorder · enter save · esc cancel
